      "description": "docs/STYLEGUIDE.md rule #11 says never use the \"uppercase\" utility class - text should stay in its natural case. In src/feature/arsenal/components/GuitarInventory/GuitarCard.tsx, both the guitar brand label and the small \"New\" badge use \"uppercase\" classes. I'm not sure if this is an intentional exception for game-card badge styling or a genuine style-guide violation left over from before that rule was written. Please check whether STYLEGUIDE.md documents an exception for badges/labels like this; if not, bring it in line with the rule (or, if it turns out to be an intentional accepted style for card badges, say so instead of guessing).",
